    "asserted_at": "2026-11-10",
    "strength": "weak: one reader, unchecked"
   },
   {
    "provision": "owasp.k08",
    "relation": "part",
    "basis": "The action is a central registry of agentic systems; a published, addressable agent interface is one thing such a registry would list. It is not a registry.",
